<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Bell Atlantic.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Bell Atlantic.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Bell Atlantic Corp to a near- and long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday the Justice Department announced the unconditional approval of Bell Atlantic's merger with NYNEX Corp.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3-3/8 to 62.</p>
</text>
